{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend Into a Dying World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plague did not fade. It burrowed deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath shattered kingdoms and frost-scarred forests, something ancient is stirring again. Each descent into the dungeon reveals fractured ruins, forgotten prisons, and horrors twisted by corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is procedurally generated.<br>Every floor reshapes the battlefield.<br>Every choice pushes you closer to the source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight. Adapt. Descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.poster.avif?t=1772518678\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.webm?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.mp4?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1\u20136 Player Co-Op Carnage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone \u2014 or bring allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party of up to six players and carve through shifting dungeon floors filled with elite enemies, ambush encounters, and brutal bosses. Revive fallen allies, hold the frontline, or unleash devastation from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plague does not scale down its cruelty.<br>Neither should you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/a5cac4aea512b04d7cc03927a2048761.avif?t=1772518678\" width=830 height=424 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Synergy That Evolves Each Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every floor, you choose how you evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful passives that modify abilities, trigger on-hit effects, empower allies, or transform your role entirely. Stack synergies. Break combinations. Discover unexpected interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs feel the same.<br>No two builds play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.poster.avif?t=1772518678\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.webm?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.mp4?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat With Weight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike lands with impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block at the last second. Break enemy poise. Interrupt deadly casts. Chain abilities into devastating combos. Master positioning, stamina, and timing \u2014 because reckless aggression will get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast. Heavy. Intentional.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.poster.avif?t=1772518678\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.webm?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.mp4?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons That Define Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon is your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield sword and shield to dominate the frontline.<br>Strike from the shadows with daggers.<br>Unleash arcane destruction through staves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon changes how you fight \u2014 abilities, pacing, and combat rhythm included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/048d89f0f53bc0be20faee8da4aaa79b.avif?t=1772518678\" width=1187 height=984 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dungeon That Fights Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three escalating floors.<br>Safe rooms to choose your fate.<br>A boss that will test everything you\u2019ve built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero.<br>You are Plagueborn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2774130?t=1772518678","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/90dc3a35da609deb507aa846a272b511194ec995/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772518678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/661b9d6181d6551ac52c9420c174d1b64c396b42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772518678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/661b9d6181d6551ac52c9420c174d1b64c396b42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772518678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"descriptio