b04d7cc03927a2048761.avif?t=1772518678\" width=830 height=424 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Synergy That Evolves Each Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every floor, you choose how you evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain powerful passives that modify abilities, trigger on-hit effects, empower allies, or transform your role entirely. Stack synergies. Break combinations. Discover unexpected interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs feel the same.<br>No two builds play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.poster.avif?t=1772518678\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.webm?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.mp4?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat With Weight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strike lands with impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block at the last second. Break enemy poise. Interrupt deadly casts. Chain abilities into devastating combos. Master positioning, stamina, and timing \u2014 because reckless aggression will get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast. Heavy. Intentional.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.poster.avif?t=1772518678\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.webm?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.mp4?t=1772518678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons That Define Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapon is your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield sword and shield to dominate the frontline.<br>Strike from the shadows with daggers.<br>Unleash arcane destruction through staves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon changes how you fight \u2014 abilities, pacing, and combat rhythm included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/048d89f0f53bc0be20faee8da4aaa79b.avif?t=1772518678\" width=1187 height=984 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dungeon That Fights Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three escalating floors.<br>Safe rooms to choose your fate.<br>A boss that will test everything you\u2019ve built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero.<br>You are Plagueborn.</p>","developers":["Jeremiah Mauga"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/86265ede6c38a0f29df41b78378a3131ea6ca1a1/header.jpg?t=1772518678","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Plagueborn","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit, Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256mb Video Memory</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recom